Z||000009||contra||06-02-2000||01:42 PM||||if you have the cash to blow on the engine<BR>get a highpowered acceleration coil for starters, some heavier gauge wiring for the spark plugs, maybe even those quad prong spark plugs that make a larger spark, get a race style ignition module that can withstand higher revvs than the fiero is supposed to take, maybe up the idle a little higher (not sure about that one), use the high octane gas and any other suppliments, make sure your tires are a good pressure, and maybe a hypertech chip? =)<BR>oh and one last thing, clean out everything you can like your K&N, maybe clean your carb, and check everything else.<P>i've almost done all that stuff to my car and it's an auto, and it goes pretty darn fast.<BR>best of luck to you, i'm sure you'll win though<p>[This message has been edited by contra (edited 06-02-2000).]||||reg||1
