Z||000018||olympic||06-02-2000||10:50 PM||||   Pump the font tires up to 50 psi and lower the rear tire pressure to 20 psi.  Less rolling resistance up front and more traction out back.  Dump all extras out of the car like CD's, spare tire, sub box, girlfriend    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> , etc.  Switch to Mobil 1 synthetic oil.  And as stated by others, a new set of plugs and wires can't hurt if they're more than 2 years old.  Good luck!<P><p>[This message has been edited by olympic (edited 06-02-2000).]||||reg||3
