Z||000032||FieroSTETZ||06-07-2000||03:01 PM||||hahha! i was driving my familys old automatic grocery getter (1987 mazda626 GT turbo) and, at a light, i look over, and who is that next to me? its... the guy who wants to race my fiero! well, i cant let this one go, i like this car, its a sleeper! so, i drop it into neutral and give it a rev, just a bit, not enough to make the turbo whine audible- put it back into gear and start powerbraking. the light turns green, and he chirps his tires, but i already have about 2 feet on him (its an auto, kinda slow off the line) well, once i enter the old 4doors wacky powerband, the car sorta- leaps forward, and i stay about half a car on the damn 3kGT until the next light, where he turns into the parking lot for home depot. (if anyone is wondering, i was driving the mazda instead of the fiero because i wont drive it with a possible engine problem) well, i am gonna see if he has anything to say today- i am now rip roaring ro kick his (posterior) with my GT- the problem with MOST young kids with fast cars- they cant drive. -=Takes a Bow=- thank you all for your time!!!! yeah baby!!! woohoo! i kinda have a soft spot in my heard for that old mazda- have not driven it in a while. its kinda cool to have a quick car that gets 35mpg. (btw, if the race was any longer than light to light, the sh!tmobile woulda run out of steam, its quick, not fast.)||||reg||10
